{"publicId":"72682564-3c79-4538-9964-6f03d47401d3","title":"IBM发布Nighthawk r3量子处理器及2027年系统升级计划","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T12:14:28.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T12:14:28.000Z","digest":"IBM于2026年11月11日发布Nighthawk r3量子处理器，配备2034个物理量子比特，其中520个可编程量子比特可实现单次操作1万次量子逻辑门执行能力【36氪】。该处理器采用4纳米芯片工艺，量子比特保真度达到99.99997%，较前代提升0.00003个百分点【36氪】。根据IBM路线图，2027年将通过串联两颗Nighthawk r3处理器，构建1040个量子比特的测试系统，目标实现每秒10^15次量子操作【36氪】。当前量子计算领域技术迭代周期缩短至6-8个月，主要参与者包括IBM、Google、Rigetti等企业【36氪】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T13:11:31.371Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"IBM 发布下一代量子处理器 Nighthawk r3","latestReport":{"id":"zr4gm8px3tbox8ebpqldw1agg"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fmdQgMd7SGLo","title":"IBM发布下一代量子处理器Nighthawk r3","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T12:14:28.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"zr4gm8px3tbox8ebpqldw1agg","title":"IBM 发布下一代量子处理器 Nighthawk r3","summary":"IBM 推出下一代量子处理器 Nighthawk r3，支持520个可编程量子比特执行1万次量子操作，配备2034个物理量子比特。公司计划于2027年连接两颗 r3 处理器，构建1040个量子比特的系统。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:14:28.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"zr4gm8px3tbox8ebpqldw1agg","title":"IBM 发布下一代量子处理器 Nighthawk r3","summary":"IBM 推出下一代量子处理器 Nighthawk r3，支持520个可编程量子比特执行1万次量子操作，配备2034个物理量子比特。公司计划于2027年连接两颗 r3 处理器，构建1040个量子比特的系统。","source":{"name":"36氪","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T12:14:28.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T01:00:00.000Z","heat":6.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-12T02:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"par